ATTRIBUTION (mandatory, do not remove)

API knowledge in this project was derived from observing public traffic and the
following open-source references (all unofficial, research/educational use):

- GoBiz/GoPay Merchant: kavionn/gobiz-payment (primary reference),
  warungerik/API-GOPAY-MERCHANT, alhifnywahid/merchantid,
  ahmadzakiyox/gopay-api-gateaway, namtxs/gopay-api (customer-side comparison).
- ShopeePay Partner (roadmap): alhifnywahid/merchantid (primary reference),
  ahmadzakiyox/shoppepay-api-gateway (README/architecture; code is obfuscated).

This project is NOT affiliated with GoTo/GoPay/GoBiz, Shopee/Sea Group, or any
of the reference authors. See research/RESEARCH_GOPAY_SHOPEEPAY.md for details.
